.html\n\nSince this is a test specification, I should look at where test specs are typically stored in this project. Let me first explore the project structure to understand where to place this file.","format":"anthropic-claude-v1","index":0,"signature":"850b53dca0cd77ffb4bc6dcc7a2edbd2b512f7b4c808726aab15ea7a0ac34550"}]}}}}
